{"metadata":{"title":"Hyperparameter Tuning & AutoML Engine","modules":[{"name":"SwiftOptimize"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"text":"Automate model exploration and parameter optimization with ","type":"text"},{"code":"GridSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"RandomizedSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and the intelligent ","type":"text"},{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" model selector.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/HyperparameterTuning","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds","doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection"],"title":"Guides & Tutorials","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Finding the optimal combination of hyperparameters is critical for maximizing generalization accuracy. ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftOptimize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides exhaustive grid search, randomized sampling for high-dimensional parameter spaces, and end-to-end ","type":"text"},{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" selection across multiple model families.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"1. AutoML — Automated Model & Parameter Selection","level":2,"anchor":"1-AutoML-Automated-Model--Parameter-Selection","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" evaluates candidate model architectures (Decision Trees, Random Forests, Logistic Regression, Linear Regression, and Multi-Layer Perceptrons) using cross-validation, ranking candidates by performance metrics (F1-score for classification, R² for regression).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ 1. Synthetic classification dataset","let N = 120","let D = 4","let X = (0..<N).map { i in","    (0..<D).map { d in Double(i * D + d) * 0.05 + sin(Double(i + d)) }","}","let y = (0..<N).map { i in i % 2 }","","\/\/ 2. Configure AutoML with 3-fold cross validation","let autoML = AutoML(","    task: .classification,","    timeLimitSeconds: 30,","    cvFolds: 3,","    metric: \"f1\"",")","","\/\/ 3. Train and select the optimal estimator","let result = try await autoML.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","print(\"=== AutoML Optimization Results ===\")","print(\"Selected Best Model: \\(result.bestModelName)\")","print(\"Validation F1 Score: \\(String(format: \"%.4f\", result.bestScore))\")","print(\"Tuned Hyperparameters: \\(result.bestParameters)\")","","\/\/ 4. Run inference directly on new test samples","let newSample = [0.5, 1.2, 0.3, 0.8]","let testPrediction = try await result.bestEstimator.predict(features: [newSample])","print(\"Prediction: \\(testPrediction)\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"2. Exhaustive Grid Search (`GridSearchCV`)","level":2,"anchor":"2-Exhaustive-Grid-Search-GridSearchCV","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"GridSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" exhaustively tests all Cartesian combinations of hyperparameter discrete values.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ Define hyperparameter search grid for DecisionTreeClassifier","let paramGrid: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"maxDepth\": [3, 5, 8],","    \"minSamplesSplit\": [2, 5, 10],","    \"criterion\": [\"gini\", \"entropy\"]","]","","let gridSearch = GridSearchCV(","    estimator: DecisionTreeClassifier(maxDepth: 3),","    paramGrid: paramGrid,","    cv: 5,","    scoring: .accuracy",")","","try await gridSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","if let bestParams = gridSearch.bestParams {","    print(\"Optimal Depth: \\(bestParams[\"maxDepth\"] ?? \"default\")\")","    print(\"Peak CV Accuracy: \\(String(format: \"%.4f\", gridSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0))\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"3. Randomized Search (`RandomizedSearchCV`)","level":2,"anchor":"3-Randomized-Search-RandomizedSearchCV","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When searching through large continuous or discrete combinatorial spaces, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomizedSearchCV"},{"text":" samples $N$ random configurations, finding near-optimal solutions in a fraction of the compute time.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","let distributions: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"learningRate\": [0.001, 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.1],","    \"epochs\": [100, 200, 500, 1000],","    \"l2Penalty\": [0.0, 0.0001, 0.001, 0.01]","]","","let randomSearch = RandomizedSearchCV(","    estimator: LogisticRegression(learningRate: 0.01),","    paramDistributions: distributions,","    nIter: 20,","    cv: 3,","    randomSeed: 42",")","","try await randomSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","print(\"Top Configuration Score: \\(randomSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0)\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/hyperparametertuning"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize"]]},"references":{"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/ParallelModelSelection":{"title":"Concurrent Model Selection & Cross-Validation","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/parallelmodelselection","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection","abstract":[{"text":"Harness all available Apple Silicon CPU and GPU cores using structured Swift Concurrency ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TaskGroup"},{"text":" primitives.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"AutoML, Cross-Validation Folds & Hyperparameter Tuning.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize","kind":"symbol","title":"SwiftOptimize"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/CrossValidationFolds":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Evaluate model stability and generalization performance across dataset splits using ","type":"text"},{"code":"KFold","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"StratifiedKFold","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeSeriesSplit"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/crossvalidationfolds","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds","role":"article","title":"Cross-Validation Strategies"}}}